; 1CustomZigZag_BuildPlate
; Bambu Lab P1S, 0.2 mm nozzle, PETG
; Two mirrored zigzags directly on build plate; no rectangular base
; Four layers: Z0.06, Z0.12, Z0.18, Z0.24; line width 0.15 mm
; Each path: original 21-tip zigzag at nominal 0.3 mm pitch, 10 mm straight intro/outro
; First layer 10 mm/s; remaining three layers 1 mm/s
; Nozzle 255 C; bed 80 C; nozzle purge-line XY speed 25 mm/s
; P1S startup retained; conditional mesh area expanded for the longer model
; No printer test performed
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_START
M201 X20000 Y20000 Z500 E5000
M203 X500 Y500 Z20 E30
M204 P20000 R5000 T20000
M205 X9.00 Y9.00 Z3.00 E2.50 ; sets the jerk limits, mm/sec
M106 S0
M106 P2 S0
